/* ray_probe.comp -- vk_rayprobe: one ray through the main TLAS, every hit
 * a candidate (none confirmed), the first 32 recorded as uvec4 (t bits,
 * custom index, TLAS instance, primitive) after a count in h[0].x; the
 * instances by a mask (5.6: vk_materials here takes the primary rays'),
 * or with nearest every candidate confirmed and the nearest alone (the
 * first 32 are in traversal order, not by distance)
